Diff←{
⍝ '' if text ⍵ matches expected text ⍺, else where they first differ.
    ⍺≡⍵:''
    a b←{⍵⊆⍨⍵≠LF}¨ToLF¨⍺ ⍵
    i←⊃⍸(n↑a)≢¨(n←⌊/≢¨a b)↑b
    c←' (',(⍕+/~a∊b),' expected line(s) missing, ',(⍕+/~b∊a),' unexpected)'
    i=0:'differs after line ',(⍕n),' (or only in whitespace/line endings)',c
    'line ',(⍕i),': expected "',(i⊃a),'" got "',(i⊃b),'"',c
}
